For integers $n$, let \[f(n) = \left\{
\begin{array}{cl}
n^2 & \text{ if }n\text{ is odd}, \\
n^2 - 4n - 1 & \text{ if }n\text{ is even}.
\end{array}
\right.\]Find $f(f(f(f(f(4)))))$.

```python
def nested_function():
    """For integers $n$, let \[f(n) = \left\{
\begin{array}{cl}
n^2 & \text{ if }n\text{ is odd}, \\
n^2 - 4n - 1 & \text{ if }n\text{ is even}.
\end{array}
\right.\]Find $f(f(f(f(f(4)))))$."""
    # Define the function
    def f(n):
        if n % 2 == 0:
            return n**2 - 4*n - 1
        else:
            return n**2

    # Compute f(f(f(f(f(4)))))
    result = f(f(f(f(f(4)))))

    return result

result = nested_function()
print(result)
```

