    """Let \[f(n) = \left\{
\begin{array}{cl}
\lfloor n \rfloor & \text{ if }n \geq 4, \\
\lceil n \rceil & \text{ if } n < 4.
\end{array}
\right.\]Find $f\left(\frac{\pi}{3}\right) + f(\sqrt{45}) + f(8^{2/3})$."""
    f_pi_over_3 = floor(pi/3) if pi/3 >= 4 else ceiling(pi/3)
    f_sqrt_45 = floor(sqrt(45)) if sqrt(45) >= 4 else ceiling(sqrt(45))
    f_8_to_the_2_over_3 = floor(8**(2/3)) if 8**(2/3) >= 4 else ceiling(8**(2/3))

